Dear Sir,

 

Please see below services we have to mention for CCS services in Aries web
page.

 

*  Hydro jetting services

*  Lancing of Pipelines and Grey Water Lines at Offshore Rig

*  Drain Line Cleaning at Shipyards

*  Internal Cleaning of Tube Line

*  Industrial blasting & Coatings-Drilling handling tools, Containers, Pipe
lines, Racks , skids, Bolts ,Flanges, Pressure vessels etc.

*  Pipeline internal blasting and coating

*  Ballast Tanks Maintenance Program

*  Deck maintenance  program

*  Silo tank cleaning & refurbishment

*  Rig Accommodation maintenance program- Protection against corrosion,
maintaining the appearance of the Rigs and clean living atmosphere for the
personnel onboard.

*  Coating Inspection & coating condition assessment

*  Cargo Hold maintenance-Coating maintenance and product change washing by
using man lift

*  Cleaning Jobs-Ballast tank Mud cleaning

*  Helideck maintenance-To maintain CAP 437 requirements by sufficient
friction and required markings.

 

                

 

 

Kind Regards

 

From Aries Group, Qatar
Ananthu M R
